+Exact `$SDH` and `$SII` lookup remains green for all 29 live IDs.
+
+The nonempty fixture SHA-256 is
+`ba27141c7fac317013fdb8ec3de5692a3e467a20b5875f8aa5e1d4de68790de6`.
